# IMX round 3: the Synth Automation page on Tracker+ (SynthAutomation.cpp on the stock synth parts, slots in core/AudioEngine/partAuto.h).
# Instr held + Up x3 picks Synth 1, Params opens Synth Parameters 1/4, Params again Synth Macros 2/4, again Synth Automation 3/4. F3 puts the
# frame on Type, Down turns slot 1 to an LFO on its first destination (Part Pan), the LFO runs with the audio callback (plus_flows.sh replays with
# --wav), Delete on Type turns the slot Off again. The column values are drawn as second texts the
# capture does not hold, the expects read the column labels (Shape and Speed show for an LFO only). Ends on the poke read (UISHOT_TRACE_PARTAUTO): slot 1 went LFO on Pan, the engine took the
# Pan destination with moving values, and at the end the slot is Off, the store mask is 0 and Synth 1's Pan is back at its base
title: Synth Automation page on Tracker+ (IMX round 3)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
tap Params
wait 1200ms
tap Params
wait 1200ms
tap Params
wait 1500ms
expect text "Synth Automation 3/4"
expect text "Destination"
tap F3
wait 400ms
tap Down
wait 1500ms
expect text "Shape"
expect text "Speed"
shot synthauto-lfo
tap Delete
wait 1200ms
expect no-text "Shape"
shot synthauto-off
